This product includes a vendored copy of the IP-to-ASN table published by
iptoasn.com, at crates/topgent-ui/data/ip2asn-combined.tsv.gz.

That table is released into the public domain under the Open Data Commons
Public Domain Dedication and Licence (PDDL) 1.0:

    https://opendatacommons.org/licenses/pddl/1-0/

It is compiled at build time into the address-ownership table the interface
uses to name the country and the announcing network for an endpoint. It is
redistributed unmodified; the PDDL permits redistribution, including inside a
binary, with no attribution requirement. This notice is given anyway.

The table is a snapshot. Run scripts/fetch-networks.sh to refresh it. Topgent
never fetches it at runtime, and never fetches it during a build.

